It's a skill that your AI agent runs,

11
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:22,450
in Claude Code, Cursor or Codex.

12
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:25,690
You drop the PDF in a folder and type:

13
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:27,750
turn this into a PPT.

14
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,680
Or paste your notes straight into the

15
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:30,130
chat.

16
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:32,910
First, it agrees on a plan with you:

17
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,630
the template, sixteen by nine,

18
00:00:34,650 --> 00:00:36,030
eight to ten pages.

19
